{"2899100": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Degenerates", "steam_appid": 2899100, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Degenerates is an action-packed superhero game. Take control of three unique superheroes, each wielding devastating powers based around <strong>Earth, Telekinesis, and Electricity</strong>. Master their abilities, tear through waves of enemies, and turn the battlefield into your weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899100/extras/49cc99eeefabb8d0a6d115465fa8fb26.poster.avif?t=1786244105\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899100/extras/49cc99eeefabb8d0a6d115465fa8fb26.webm?t=1786244105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899100/extras/49cc99eeefabb8d0a6d115465fa8fb26.mp4?t=1786244105\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Play as three distinct heroes, each with their own powerful abilities and combat style. Manipulate the earth, control objects with telekinesis, or unleash devastating electrical attacks as you fight your way through hordes of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899100/extras/964e4c1d59690bc54480104a538245ab.poster.avif?t=1786244105\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899100/extras/964e4c1d59690bc54480104a538245ab.webm?t=178624